# i18n and Copy Rules

- Keep user-facing text in `~/i18n/en.ts` and `~/i18n/bn.ts`.
- Add/update keys in both locales in the same change.
- Do not leave placeholder or untranslated strings in production routes.
- Form field markers use `common.optional` and `common.requiredForReview` (see `50-field-requirements.mdc`).
